		(descr "Abracon AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T 3.3uH polarity-marked molded power inductor (custom part for the RP235x core regulator), 2.0x1.6x1.0mm, land pattern per Abracon datasheet Rev A 2024-09-13 (1.00x1.60mm pads, 1.00mm gap). Pad 1 = white polarity dot = VOUT/DVDD side, pad 2 = VREG_LX, per RP2350 datasheet Figs. 25/26/28. 3D model is a stand-in with the same 2.0x1.6x1.0mm body (Changjiang FTC201610S). https://abracon.com/datasheets/AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T.pdf")
